"Jennifer's dog has 8 puppies, 3 of which have spots. Brandon's dog has 12 puppies, none of which have spots. What percentage of all the puppies have spots?","Jennifer's dog has 8 puppies, 3 of which have spots. Brandon's dog has 12 puppies, 4 of which have spots. What percentage of all the puppies have spots?",35,35,15,35,"To solve this problem step by step:

